  "definition_ja": "平面図形や曲面が占める広さを、単位の正方形がいくつ分かで表した量。",
  "definition_en": "The amount of surface a region or figure covers, measured by how many unit squares it takes to cover it.",
  "latex": "A = \\frac{1}{2}bh",
  "spoken_en": "A equals one half base times height",
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "The area of a triangle is one half base times height, so here it's one half times 6 times 4, which is 12 square centimeters.",
      "ja": "三角形の面積は底辺 × 高さ ÷ 2 だから、ここでは 6 × 4 ÷ 2 で 12 cm² だね。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Find the area of a triangle with sides of length 5 and 8 and an included angle of 30°.",
      "ja": "2 辺の長さが 5 と 8 で、その間の角が 30° である三角形の面積を求めよ。",
      "register": "written"
    }
  ],
  "collocations": [
    {
      "en": "area of a triangle",
      "ja": "三角形の面積"
    },
    {
      "en": "find the area",
      "ja": "面積を求める"
    }
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "面積の単位 cm² は square centimeters と読む（centimeters squared とも言う）。答えに単位を付けるときは square units。",
    "立体の表面の広さ（表面積）は surface area で、area だけとは言い分ける。",
    "統計では、正規分布などの曲線の下の面積が確率を表す（the area under the curve）。"
  ],
